  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 8\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot 1+(-4)\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 5 \\\\ 3\\cdot (1)+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 5 \\\\ 5\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-2)+8\\cdot 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2+8+5 \\\\ 3+4+25 \\\\ 5+2+40\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}15 \\\\ 32 \\\\ 47\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
